title: Test_NPC
---
Stranger: Evening. You look like you need a bit of luck.
<<if money() >= 10>>
    Stranger: {money()} coins in your pocket. Not bad.
<<else>>
    Stranger: Empty pockets, huh?
<<endif>>
-> Ask for money
    <<give_money 10>>
    Stranger: Here. Don't spend it all at the table.
-> Ask for a lucky number
    <<if has_lucky_number(5)>>
        Stranger: You already have mine.
    <<else>>
        <<give_lucky_number 5>>
        Stranger: Take five. It never let me down.
    <<endif>>
-> Ask to learn something
    <<if has_ability("Dash")>>
        Stranger: You already know everything I know.
    <<else>>
        <<unlock_ability Dash>>
        Stranger: Watch closely. Like this.
    <<endif>>
-> Leave
    Stranger: Suit yourself.
===
